## Hello, Fall (theme-specific)

> **Fall = what’s especially worth doing with little ones right now** — not “Fall = pumpkins.”

### Litmus (Hello Fall)

> If it isn’t special because it’s fall / September, don’t make it a Fall Pick.

### Pillars

| Pillar | Include |
|--------|---------|
| **Harvest & farms** | Pumpkin patches, apple picking, farm days |
| **Outdoor fall outings** | Nature, outdoor events, fall family activities |
| **Seasonal celebrations** | Mid-Autumn Festival, Diwali, community fall festivals |

### Hello Fall examples

| Keep | Move to regular browse |
|------|------------------------|
| Harvest History Festival, Mid-Autumn storytimes, pumpkin farms | Yoga / FIT4MOM / weekly storytime / Malinky Music |
| Light September pick (e.g. back-to-school workshop) — optional | Art Studios Open House, Train Day (weak fall tie) |

Feature Spina Farms (and similar late-open patches) near open date (~9/17), not in the early-September carousel.

Hello Fall runs through **~Oct 5** (Diwali / Sunnyvale Mid-Autumn weekend); Halloween module starts **Oct 6**.

